[{"id":8,"title":"Runner 0.19.0 发布：分屏采用 island 布局，提供 Linux 支持","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/t/8","content":"新版本主要变化：\n\n- 分屏布局改为 island 风格\n- 正式支持 Linux\n- 性能优化\n\n欢迎大家试用反馈。","content_rendered":"<p>新版本主要变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>分屏布局改为 island 风格</li>\n<li>正式支持 Linux</li>\n<li>性能优化</li>\n</ul>\n<p>欢迎大家试用反馈。</p>\n","replies":2,"member":{"id":2,"username":"lisi","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/member/lisi","tagline":null,"bio":null,"created":1794151867,"last_modified":1794151867,"location":null,"website":null,"twitter":null,"github":null,"psn":null,"btc":null,"pro":0,"avatar_mini":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_normal":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_large":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_xlarge":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_xxlarge":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_xxxlarge":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"},"node":{"id":1,"name":"programmer","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/go/programmer","title":"程序员","title_alternative":"程序员","topics":1,"stars":1,"header":"","footer":"","founder_id":1,"root":true,"parent_node_name":"","aliases":[],"avatar_mini":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_normal":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","avatar_large":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,"},"created":1794135410,"last_modified":1794135410,"last_touched":1794135530,"last_reply_by":"zhaoliu","deleted":0},{"id":5,"title":"压缩的尽头是自指？从 LZMA2、PAQ8PX 到 zstd/ZIP/RAR Quine，我折腾了一遍","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/t/5","content":"最近对\"自解压\"这个方向产生了兴趣，花了些时间研究压缩格式的自指性质。\n\n从 LZMA2 的窗口回绕，到 PAQ8PX 的上下文建模，再到 zstd 的块结构……最后我尝试构造了一个能够自我展开的归档格式。\n\n结论是：理论上可行，但工程上没什么意义。","content_rendered":"<p>最近对\"自解压\"这个方向产生了兴趣，花了些时间研究压缩格式的自指性质。</p>\n<p>从 LZMA2 的窗口回绕，到 PAQ8PX 的上下文建模，再到 zstd 的块结构……最后我尝试构造了一个能够自我展开的归档格式。</p>\n<p>结论是：理论上可行，但工程上没什么意义。</p>\n","replies":3,"member":{"id":2,"username":"lisi","url":"http://127.0.0.1:3210/member/lisi","tagline":null,"bio":null,"created":1794151867,"last_modified":1794151867,"location":null,"website":null,"twitter":null,"github":null,"psn":null,"btc":null,"pro":0,"avatar_mini":"data:ima